---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="P5｜Glass Core">

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-inner">
    <div class="kicker">VOL.01 · P5 · GLASS CORE</div>
    <h1>Glass Core：結果，而不是起點</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">

  <article class="card reading">

    <span class="tag">GLASS CORE</span>

    <p>
      Glass Core 不應被單獨理解成一項材料題材。
      更值得觀察的是它在 AI 封裝尺寸、密度與訊號完整性
      持續提升下所扮演的角色。
    </p>

    <div class="tech-flow">
      <span>Glass</span>
      <b>→</b>
      <span>TGV</span>
      <b>→</b>
      <span>Core Substrate</span>
      <b>→</b>
      <span>Advanced Packaging</span>
      <b>→</b>
      <span>AI Accelerator</span>
    </div>

    <p>
      後續研究將持續追蹤技術驗證、製程整合、
      良率、量產時間與客戶導入。
    </p>

  </article>

</section>

<section class="page-nav">
  <a href="/research/vol01/p4">← P4</a>
  <a href="/research/vol01">Vol.01 Index</a>
  <a href="/research/vol01/p6">P6 →</a>
</section>

<style>
  .tech-flow {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 28px 0;
  }

  .tech-flow span {
    padding: 9px 12px;
    border: 1px solid #354457;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #0b1119;
  }

  .tech-flow b {
    color: #7188a0;
  }
</style>

</BaseLayout>
